./batch04/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,Y,e_X,e_Y\\in V\">\\(C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,Y,e_X,e_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2_{\\mathbb P}:=\\{X:\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,2)\\}\">\\(L^2_{\\mathbb P}:=\\{X:\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,2)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X]\">\\(\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X]\\)</span> is the value specified by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(C,L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\times L^2_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(C,L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\times L^2_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2CovarianceFunctional}_S(C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2CovarianceFunctional}_S(C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}covariance\\text{-}l2\\text{-}domain} \\vdash L^2_{\\mathbb P}=\\{X\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,2)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}covariance\\text{-}l2\\text{-}domain} \\vdash L^2_{\\mathbb P}=\\{X\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,2)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}covariance\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2CovarianceFunctional}_S(C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\times L^2_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\exists e_X,e_Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S(e_X,X,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S(e_Y,Y,\\mathbb P)\\land C(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)=\\int_\\Omega(X(\\omega)-e_X)(Y(\\omega)-e_Y)\\,d\\mathbb P(\\omega)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}covariance\\text{-}functional} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2CovarianceFunctional}_S(C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\times L^2_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\;\\exists e_X,e_Y\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S(e_X,X,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S(e_Y,Y,\\mathbb P)\\land C(\\langle X,Y\\rangle)=\\int_\\Omega(X(\\omega)-e_X)(Y(\\omega)-e_Y)\\,d\\mathbb P(\\omega)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This defines a functional on pairs of real square-integrable random variables. The <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> domain supplies measurability and integrability, and the expectation is explicitly relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9120e73a451193b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob2-expectation-functional.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"cebc92aa41f3a49c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,Y,e_X,e_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"L^2_{\\mathbb P}:=\\{X:\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,2)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_{\\mathbb P}[X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ExpectationFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(C,L^2_{\\mathbb P}\\times L^2_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2CovarianceFunctional}_S(C,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}covariance\\text{-}l2\\text{-}domain} \\vdash L^2_{\\mathbb P}=